  (text "MCU supply (DS12288): 100 nF at each VDD (24, 36, 48) and VBAT, 10 uF bulk.\nVDDA: +3V3 through BLM15HD102 bead, 1 uF + 10 nF. VREF+: internal VREFBUF 2.9 V\n(docs/research/adc.md), 1 uF + 100 nF only, nothing else drives VREFP." (at 12.7 220.98 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 1e4bed73-6a78-5702-8d88-123d88c0b25b))
  (label "VDDA" (at 63.5 241.3 0) (fields_autoplaced) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid bad22830-8678-5f67-b018-9855512393a6))
