  (label "BOOT0" (at 128.27 232.41 180) (fields_autoplaced) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify right bottom)) (uuid faff2e91-5663-5265-a013-da38cf5f8db4))
  (label "LED" (at 154.94 250.19 0) (fields_autoplaced) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 20ea8789-c62b-58cd-8e2e-4a51e2f72077))
  (text "NRST 100 nF; BOOT0 low (close JP701 for the\nUSB DFU / USART1 bootloader); LED on PC13, active low." (at 106.68 252.73 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 060dc228-ebbe-5158-b6c6-209709fcacbc))
  (text "STM32G474CBT6 pin plan:\n 8 PA0   ADC_IN        ADC12_IN1 (fast channel), sampler output\n 9 PA1   NC            spare (ADC12_IN2)\n10 PA2   DAC_BIAS_A    OPAMP1_VOUT follower of DAC3_CH1 -> VBIAS_A stage\n11 PA3   NC            spare\n12 PA4   DAC_TRIG      DAC1_OUT1 -> TRIG_LEVEL stage\n13 PA5   DAC_OFS       DAC1_OUT2 -> VOFS stage\n14 PA6   DAC_TAPTH     DAC2_OUT1 -> VTAP_TH divider\n15 PA7   NC            spare\n30 PA8   NC            reserved: OPAMP5_VOUT (DAC4_CH2 follower, spare analog output)\n31 PA9   HOST_TX       USART1_TX (AF7) -> 100R R512 -> J501 pin 4\n32 PA10  HOST_RX       USART1_RX (AF7) <- 100R R511 <- J501 pin 2\n33 PA11  USB_DM        USB FS D-\n34 PA12  USB_DP        USB FS D+ (internal 1.5k pull-up)\n37 PA13  UC_SWDIO      SWDIO -> J501 pin 8\n38 PA14  UC_SWCLK      SWCLK -> J501 pin 10\n39 PA15  I2C_SCL       I2C1_SCL (AF4) -> MS5351M\n 7 PG10  UC_NRST       NRST, 100 nF -> J501 pin 14\n 5 PF0   MCU_CLK       OSC_IN, HSE bypass from MS5351M CLK1\n 6 PF1   NC            OSC_OUT unused in bypass\n 2 PC13  LED           status LED D701, active low\n 3 PC14  NC            spare\n 4 PC15  NC            spare\n16 PB0   FPGA_DONE     GPIO in (FPGA DONE)\n17 PB1   DAC_BIAS_K    OPAMP3_VOUT follower of DAC3_CH2 -> VBIAS_K stage\n18 PB2   FPGA_RECONFIG GPIO open-drain (FPGA RECONFIG_N)\n40 PB3   SPI_SCK       SPI1_SCK (AF5), master\n41 PB4   SPI_MISO      SPI1_MISO (AF5); UCPD dead-battery pull-down until disabled\n42 PB5   SPI_MOSI      SPI1_MOSI (AF5)\n43 PB6   TRIG_SEL      GPIO out (TMUX136 select); UCPD dead-battery pull-down = 0 at reset\n44 PB7   I2C_SDA       I2C1_SDA (AF4)\n45 PB8   BOOT0         BOOT0: 10k pull-down, JP701 to +3V3 for the bootloader\n46 PB9   DBG1          GPIO, debug -> J501 pin 12\n22 PB10  SPI_CS        GPIO, SPI chip select (software NSS)\n25 PB11  ADC_TRIG      EXTI11 = ADC12 regular external trigger (EXTSEL EXTI11)\n26 PB12  NC            reserved: OPAMP4_VOUT (DAC4_CH1 follower, ADC_REF_MID trim option)\n27 PB13  NC            spare\n28 PB14  NC            spare\n29 PB15  NC            spare\n20 VREF+ VREFP         VREFBUF 2.9 V output, 1 uF + 100 nF\nHOST_RX/HOST_TX named as on the yanartas sensing board (MCU as host):\nHOST_RX = MCU UART RX, HOST_TX = MCU UART TX." (at 11.43 149.86 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 2f56e499-bde3-57a6-9e67-f7442e5038db))
